+## Later-phase GPU development and operational adaptations (.11)
+
+After M05 acceptance, E and later work may use native_purpose=development_stage
+for prepare, software, calibrate, freeze, train or export. Reuse the normal stage
+interface with decision/experiment stage=scaleup, research_scope=method and the
